      },
      "message": "test(gate): split the keep_law and level_links tests into cases\n\nEach slow test of keep_law and level_links was one loop over its\ncases. Each case is now its own test, in a module with the old test\nname, so libtest runs the cases in parallel. No assert or expected\nvalue changed.\n\n- keep_law: 8 -> 31 tests (keep_law.rs 14, keep_law/stock_source.rs\n  13, keep_law/mcp.rs 4). Binary 82.0 s -> 68.0 s in debug.\n- level_links: 7 -> 25 tests (level_links.rs 22,\n  level_links/choices.rs 3). Binary 73.2 s -> 36.6 s in debug.\n\nwhole_model_pocket runs in 2.1 s since #1716 and is not changed.\nlathe_field_sim is not changed: its slowest test is one field-engine\njob of about 107 s, and a split gives no gain.\n\nRefs #1715\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
